<title>USA: TABLE-Envirotest Systems Q3 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Envirotest Systems Q3 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Months</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.24     loss	 $0.38</p>
<p> Net			  $4,133     loss	 $0.38</p>
<p> Revs			$36,909		  $32,556</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   17,347		   16,620</p>
<p>	  9 Months</p>
<p> Shr	   loss	 $0.47     loss	 $1.04</p>
<p> Net	   loss	$7,768     loss     $17,164</p>
<p> Revs		    $101,803		  $90,764</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 $16,620		   16,530</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: -- Fiscal Q3 results include an adjustment to provisions made earlier for claims, resulting from the Pennsylvania contract cancellation in 1995, that have been settled or are unlikely to present future liability.  This adjustment added approximately $3.9 million to net income. Without adjustment, company says would have reported fiscal Q3 1997 net income of approximately $0.2 million, or $0.01 a share.</p>
